<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- Zul</book>
  <para style="h">Philippians</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mp</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mən Pilipi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tǝlankur kǝ Bulus dǝ mǝn Pilipi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mən Pilipi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Tǝlan kur kǝn ɗǝl ni tǝp karǝm ami Bulus na Timoti, zher kǝ Almasihu Yesu dǝ rii mǝn tsarki ju kan mǝn kopi ni gip Filibi gwa, nǝm na mǝn ne ger den mǝn kopi na munju kan ba pi ti mbap gwa.<verse eid="PHP 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Naa dǝ zo mbatl na dǝmi zhǝlili kǝ Ba gǝmi Yam na babom Yesu Almasihu dǝm nan kǝne.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shirǝm na Yam kǝ Bulus den mǝn kopi kǝ Filibbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Gastu kup a dam kǝn gip mbatl gǝno a kur gode Yami. <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />Ko gigasiwo na ghol mbatl ni a shirǝm na Yam domici gini. <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />Argon tu kemo , kǝn ni kǝ mo gam namǝn gip pi wazu tun gastu kan kǝ kum gwa. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />A tabbate'e Yam tu kan pare pi mbuni mbap tu gip kǝno, ti ci cina har tǝ pa'i mbapi gas tu Yesu Almasihu ba pal sur gwa.<verse eid="PHP 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Ar nem dlat a tune na kup gin ko gigasi, tunkan ami ra nan kǝn gip mbatl gǝn gwa, untuni, ko ami ra na ɓali na sarsari, kǝn ra den ngashi gam namǝn gip tsare shirǝm mǝn tǝmtǝn tu kan a dlǝr dene gwa. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Yam baa shedem den kandatu a ndu shini kup gin na ndutǝn kǝ Almasihu gwa.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Shirǝm na Yam gǝn utu, dǝ ndutǝn gin nar cina-cina na momi Yam na ko gonge momi bari. <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />Muntuni baa kem kǝ mani nǝmi argontu mbuni ine, kǝdǝ gastu kan Almasihu baa pal suro, kǝ nǝra mǝn tsarki gip Kǝristi, <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />la'i na ɓatltǝn kǝ ceto gin kan ba zam gip Yesu Almasihu kǝdǝ ɗǝɗa Yam dǝ yabe ti.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓaltǝn kǝ Ɓulus kem ci cina kǝ zo shirǝmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Kǝkǝno a ndu'e kǝ momi , mir ɓyari, den argon tu zamǝno ar kemni ci cina kǝ yari zo shirǝmi. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Den untuni, ar kem mǝn bi utu kan ba ne ger den bom kǝ moniyi na mbarǝm kup mom'e sabo na Almasihu ni ɓalǝmi. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Domici kǝ ɓaltǝn mǝn ni, na womti gip mir mǝn kopiyi zam ɓa'i bigul kǝ yari shirǝm kǝ Yam bat na bǝrti. <verse eid="PHP 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Na ho bi jen ba pini wazu kǝ Almasihu gip ghuve na ndu'i gami, ama jen ngapo na zo mbatl ni wu pi wazu kǝ Almasihu. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Jeno wu pini gip ndutǝne, na momi'e, lem nika ɗe domici kǝ wazu tu kan a dlǝri ti gam gwa. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Jeno wu pini wazu kǝ Almasihu gip ndu'i gami, ba e na zo mbatl ni da'a, domici wu shin wule wi bim ni patli gam ra gip ɓaltǝn gǝni. <verse eid="PHP 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Kan ununu ar ɓitewu? Zo bar gipiwo ar ni'e, gip ko unuwo ko gip ndu'i gami ko na ho bi ni, pi wazu kǝ Almasihu wi. Den untu ni ngap a pi ghol mbatli. Aan, untu ni aa ci cina na pi ghol mbatli, <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />Domici a mom'e tǝp kǝba shirǝm na yam gin ni na ne am ra tu kan Ruhu kǝ Yesu Almasihu ba bi gwa, argon tu za mǝno ar ba dǝm kǝ ɗǝli gǝn ni. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />A pi ghol mbatli, a la mbatl es'e gip Babomo baa bim sham da'a, ama a shirǝm na ndǝri mbatli. Gip bar ju kup aa pi wo, naa dǝ Almasihu zam ɗǝɗatǝn kǝkǝn na ko gigasi tǝp karǝmi, ko ami ra na rai ko na mǝshi gwa. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Domici karǝmo, ami nǝra na rai wo Almasihu ni, amini a mǝshka ma zami ni. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />A mom kǝ pǝni da'a, ami ni a ci cina na dǝmi gip dli, ar ba dǝmim zami ni. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Mbatl gǝn tatl kawi rop, a ndu mani a pal gǝn to kar Almasihu ka, untun manim naari. <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />Ama ar mani in naar dǝ a dǝm nan kǝn gip dli. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Ama a mom'e kup gin kǝ'i ndu'ǝmi. Ar ni kem a tabbate'e a ga kǝn kǝ dǝ kǝ nari kan kǝ dǝm na ghol mbatl gip ngǝshtǝn gin den Yesu. <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />Tǝp untuni, amini a ɗir kar kǝn eso, ki zam bar kǝ ɓe ngetl ra gip Yesu Almasihu domici kǝ argontu tǝ pi tǝp karǝm gwa.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Gip ko unu wo, pini dǝmi tu kan ndar wazu kǝ Almasihu gwa. Ko a ɗir kar kǝne ko a kum bar den kǝn ami nǝra da'a, a mom e ki ɓa hoyi gip Ruhu, bi gin nǝm domici kǝ nǝmi zo shirǝmi. <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />Ba kǝ kum ni bǝrti kǝ mǝn nge gin da'a. Muntuni baa gode wur'e baa pa'ika nan wuri, ama kǝno Yam baa ɗǝli ine. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Kǝno bi inwi den ami kǝ Almasihu ba'e kǝ dǝ kǝ ngǝsh kǝn den ti ni katl da'a, ama kǝ dǝ kum dli domici gǝs pa'e. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />Tunkan kǝn den ndotǝn gip destǝn tu kǝ shin a pa'ǝm gipi, antu kǝkǝn ma kǝ kum a'i gipi.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s">Kopi nge gam kǝ Almasihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Ra untuwo, in ɓa'i bi gul gon ra gip Almasihu, in muri mbatl gon ra kan ndutǝne ba ɗiri, in ngashi gam gon ra gip Ruhu, na ndutǝn gip guna gere, laa'i ni ghol mbatl gǝni, kan kǝ dǝmni na mbatl nǝm tǝp kǝ ba ndutǝn nǝm, kǝn ra na ngashi gam gip Ruhu, bi gin nǝm. <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />A lir kǝne, kem ni a dǝm na ghol mbatli tǝp kǝba dǝmi gin na mbatl nǝm na ndutǝn nǝm kǝn ra gip Ruhu nǝm damtǝn gin nǝm. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Ba kǝ pi ni argon gip nduǝ'i gam da'a ko na ɓe ngetle ama pali ni gam gin atli kǝ dam kǝn den ya'ǝn man gam gini. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Kopini ndu'i kǝ gam gin katl da'a, ama kopi ni ndu'i kǝ jen pa'e.<verse eid="PHP 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Dǝ pitǝn gin dǝm nǝm na kandatu kǝ Almasihu ra gwa,<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />muntu kan gip pitǝno ti Yam ni gwa, tǝ pǝn dǝmi gǝs nǝm na Yam tu ar dǝmi ti bar kǝ nǝmi jin-jin da'a. <verse eid="PHP 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Ama tǝ pali gam gǝs argonni da'a, tǝ pali gam gǝska wule zhere, nan tǝ pali gam gǝska wule nǝm gip mi gwa. <verse eid="PHP 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Nan zam ti na dli wule kǝ mbarǝmo, tǝ pali gam gǝska atli kan tǝ pǝn dǝ tǝ mǝshi, mǝshtǝni ma kǝ ɓatǝn den kini. <verse eid="PHP 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Ra untuwo, arni Yam ɗǝɗa ti gami na ko unu, kan tǝ bi ti sun tu kan man ko gonge sun gwa, <verse eid="PHP 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />kǝdǝ gip sun kǝ Yesu tuwo dǝ ko gonge gam ghurum ngusi, to Yam ka na den atli na su gǝsi na atl ka, <verse eid="PHP 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />arni ko gonge lǝka baa nǝm'e, Yesu Almasihuwo Babom ni kǝ dǝ ɗǝɗa Bǝba Yami. Wi cir wule zingesi.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cirtǝn wule zingesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Ra untuwo, kǝn ga berǝm gǝni, kandatu kan kǝ kur kum bi ba'e cina da'ǝm katl da'a, ama kǝkǝno untuyi ra cina da'ǝmi, cini cina na pi mbap kǝ zami ɗǝltǝn gin na bǝrti na dǝdartǝni. <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />Domici Yamo ti ni tǝ pi mbap gip mbatl gini, tini tǝ kem kǝ pǝn tor gip mbatl gin kan kǝ pi mbap kandatu ndar ndu'i gǝs gwa.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Pini ko unu bat na ngwartǝni ko nge nǝmi shirǝmi, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />Kǝ dǝ kǝ dǝmni dlǝran munju kan ra na wani pitǝn gam dawur da'a gwa mimir kǝ Yam munju kan raka argoni da'a kup na kǝn nǝra den dǝmi gip zhan mǝn ɗasi tu'e, lastu kǝn den cirtǝn wule pitilla gip duniya gwa, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />Tǝp kǝ ba dlǝri den shirǝm kǝ rai kǝ dǝ den pǝt kǝ Almasihuwo aa zam bi kǝ ɓe ngetl ra den a kǝtǝr katl ko a pi mbap kǝ katl da'a. <verse eid="PHP 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Ngǝshtǝn den Yesu gin na mbap gin gip Babomo ar nǝra wule hadaya kar ti, eso ko baa shotni bǝran gǝn den hadaya tuwo, aa pi ghol mbatl kǝ a pihadaya tu na ghol mbatl na kǝn kup. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Den untuni kǝn ma ki pi ghol mbatl kǝ gyatl namǝni.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ga Timoti na Abafǝroditas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />A la mbatl gip Babom Yesu den aa kar Timoti rǝn kar kǝn ka cina ɗe njem, kǝ dǝ ami ma a zam ɓa'i bigul tǝp kǝba kumi pitǝn gini. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Murgon nem ra wule ti muntu kan ba ghun ti den kǝn hoyi gwa. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Jeno bar ju den wur gwani katl ba ghun wuri, ba'e argon tu kan kǝ Yesu Almasihu gwani da'a. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Kǝ mom imnu Timoti ra gwa ca, kanda tu mǝ pi mbap kǝ yari zo shirǝm mǝn tǝmtǝn nan ti wule nya na bǝba gwa. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Ra untuwo a kum aa kari in bar nan ti na kumi argon tu ba zamǝn gwa. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Na mbatl nǝm ni ami ra gip Babomi, ar baa jima da'a aa cwati.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />A shin ar mbun e a kari in bar na erǝm gǝn Abafǝroditas. Berǝm mbap gǝn ni e ti. Berǝm ndotǝn ni esi, muntu kan kǝ karim ti ɗir dǝ tǝ pim mbap gwa. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Tǝ den ndu'i tǝ shin kup gini, ar ghun ti hoyi ma domici kǝ kum e tǝ pa ti na kumi dli. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Untu ni dli ci ti wule ti mǝsh nǝka, ama Yam kum guna gǝsi, ba'e ti ni katl da'a, kup namǝn ni. Untu ni dawo na dun mbatl narin kawi. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Ra untuwo, a ndu'e a kari in bar rǝn ka nan ti, kǝ dǝ kǝn ni kǝ shin tǝ eso ki kum tǝmi, ami ngapo ar baa ca'in ghuntǝn ka. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Nǝm tǝni na ghol mbatl gip Babomi, kan kǝ ɗǝɗa ni badǝr mbarǝm ju, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />Domici ti ni far kosak na mǝshtǝn wi den bi mbap kǝ Almasihu, tǝ bini mbatl gǝs kǝ dǝ tǝ pim ne am tu kan kǝno kǝ manim pi da gwa.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s">La'i mbatl ra gip pitǝn dli da'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Den bi pa'i bisiwo, mir ɓyari, pi ni ghol mbatl gip Babomi.Ar ghunǝm dǝ a pa rǝshi nǝm bar tu da'a, kan kǝ dǝ ar mbuni in ni.<verse eid="PHP 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Ngup kǝnni na yer ju, mbarǝm ju ba pi wani pitǝn gwa, mǝn tloyi dli ju kan ba wule sǝrtǝn wu dene gwa. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Ai mǝn ni'e sǝrtǝni, min kan mǝ bote Yam tǝp kar Ruhu gwa, mǝn zami ɗǝɗatǝnin Almasihu Yesu kan mǝ pǝn dli argon ni da gwa, <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />kup na ami na gamgǝn ami ra na tǝp kǝ zami gam tu gwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 3:4">In murgon ra'es kan ba kum wule tǝ ra na gǝs zami bigul gip dli wo, a man ti, <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />sǝrǝm ni den pǝt kǝ wuzupse, ami nye mǝn Isǝraila ni, gǝs gal kǝ banyana, laa'i nye Ibǝraniyawa. Tǝp kǝ ba kopi kulci kǝ Musa ngapo, ami nye mǝn Fasrisa ni. <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />Kǝ ba kuri gǝs kǝ kopi adini wo a kumi dli mǝn kopi Yesu naari, gip pitǝn dlat kǝ ba kopi doka kǝ Musa wo ami ra na argon mǝgǝni gam dam da'a.<verse eid="PHP 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Ama argon tu dǝmim riba faro a pali ka ndetǝn ni domici kǝ Almasihu. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Ununu esu, a pali ko unu ndetǝn ni in baa ngash na cirtǝn kǝ ndu'i Almasihu Yesu kan ami ra nari gwa, cirtǝn tu kan baa mani ngashi na argon da gwa. Domici kǝ Almasihu ni a nǝm a hol ko unu. A pali wur ho bar ni da'a kǝ dǝ a zam riba kǝ ngashi gam na Almasihu ra, <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />kǝ dǝ zamǝn gip ti, muntu ngapo ba'e tǝp kǝ ba pitǝn dlat gǝn tǝp kǝba kopi kulci kǝ Musa ni da'a, se de tǝp kǝ ba dlat pitǝn tu kan ba zam tǝp kǝ ba ngǝshtǝn den Almasihu muntu kan ar ni'e dlat pitǝn tu ba zam kar Yam tǝp kǝ ba ngǝshtǝn den Yesu gwa ni. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />A ndu'e a mom Almasihu na iko kǝ tlytǝn gǝsi kan na me gam gip kumi dli gǝsi gip palui gǝn wule ti gip mǝshtǝn gǝsi, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />domici ko tǝp imnu ar rim gip tlitǝn gǝs gip mǝshi mbarǝme.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndotǝn gip zami ci bǝni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Ba'e a zam ni kup bar ju wi da'a, ko a dǝm na laa'i, ama ami ni den kǝrce kǝ dǝ a zam argon tu Almasihu Yesu pi kǝ dǝ a zam gwa. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Mir byari, ba'e a pǝnni ami na gam gǝn a zam nǝ wi da'a. ama bar nǝm ni a pi, a mǝsǝni nǝka na argon tu tare bi ti kar wi gwa ami den ngeni bar tu kan ra cina gwa, <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Ami den ndotǝn cina kǝ dǝ a zam ɓatltǝn kǝ ci bǝni, muntu kan Yam la'ǝm bi dene kǝ tetǝn yam gip Almasihu Yesu gwa.<verse eid="PHP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Kup gǝmi kan narwi gip Ruhuwo, sai mǝ dam mini den bar ju. Ama in jen gin ra na damtǝn ka bom na untuwo, muntu ma Yam baa ɓuli in momi gip mbatl gini. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Bar ariwo ar ni'e, mǝ cini cina den lastu kan mǝ nǝm gwa.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Mir ɓyari pini kanda kǝ pitǝn gǝni, shinni munju kano pitǝn gǝzǝn ndar kandatu mǝ gode in gwa. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Kanda tu a tle in yari, ar ni a pa yari in ra na lun gere, jen ra dǝmi gǝzǝno arni wule kǝ mǝn pi gapa na mǝshtǝn kǝ Almasihu ɓa'i den kini. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Gip utu ni wu ri kǝ pa'i, tu gǝzǝn ni'e Yam gǝzǝni, bar kǝ ɓe ngetl gǝzǝno ar ni'e sham gǝzǝni. Wu la ni mbatl gǝzǝn den bar kǝ duniya. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Ba dǝmi gǝmi wo to yam kani ar ra. Sur Kani mǝn den ɓuti mǝn ɗǝli gǝmi, Yesu Almasihu, <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Muntu kan ra na iko kǝ pali ko unu atli nan ti gwa. Tǝp kǝ ba iko gǝs tu ni ti canze dli gǝmi mǝn mǝshtǝni, kan tǝ pali mi wule dli gǝs gip ɗǝɗatǝne.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Ra untuwo, mir ɓyari, kǝn ju kan ra gip mbatl gǝn ko gigasi, har ami den ndu'i shini gini, kǝn kan e ghol mbatl gǝn na rawani gǝn gwa, kandatu ki dlǝr na bi gul gin gip Babom gwa utu, kǝn berǝm gǝn kǝ ndu'i.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bii bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />A dǝli kǝm ga Yudiya na Sintiki kǝ dǝ wu nǝm ezǝn gip Babomi. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Ki ngap berǝm mbap gǝni, a lir ki, ne am mǝtli ju ra, domici wu pa wur namǝn gip yari zo shirǝm mǝn tǝmtǝni, kup na Kǝlemen na nami berǝm mbap gǝni, munju kan sun gǝzǝn ra na rǝshi gip tulan kur kǝ rai gwa.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Pini ghol mbatl gip Babom ko gigasi, aa pa yari ra, pini ghol mbatli. <verse eid="PHP 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Naa kǝ dǝm ni mǝn te mbatl kaar ka gip baltǝn gin na mbarǝm kup, mom ni'e Babom mbira wi kosak. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Ba dǝ argon ghun kǝn ni da'a, se de gip bar kupo, yari ni Yam bar ju kǝ ndu gwa, tǝp kǝba shirǝm na Yam na lirtǝne, nǝm na goodetǝne. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Tǝp untu ni Yam baa bi in muri mbatl tu kan man momi kǝ mbarǝm gwa, ar baa gaa mbatl gin na damtǝn gin gip Almasihu Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Kǝ pa'i bisi wo, ɓyari, kup argon tu kan ge shirǝm ni, na argon tu baa kem ɗǝɗatǝne, kup argon tu kan dlat ni, kup argon tu kan ra ngǝlan, kup argon tu kan ba ɗiri ndutǝne, na kup argon tu kan kǝ ho mbatl ni, wato den bar ju kup kan mani mbuntǝni, ko argon tu kan kǝm ɗǝɗatǝne, den munju ni ki dam kǝne. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Bar ju jup kan kǝ kulci ko kǝ nǝmi ko kǝ shin gipǝni, la ni gip mbap gini. Yam kǝ muri mbatl baa dǝm nan kǝne.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Goode den bii bar kǝ mǝn kopi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />A pi ghol mbatl nar gip Babomi nan den pa'iwo kǝ kǝ pa gode'e kǝnra namǝn gwa. Untu ni, far ma kǝn ra namǝni, ama kǝ zam tǝp kɑn ki godem gwa da'ini. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Ba'e a yari ni muntu den a hol ni argon da'a, domici a kulci dǝmi gip kandatu kup a zam gam gǝn gwa wi. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />A mom kanda tu aa dǝm gwa ko gip holi zami bari ko gip zami bari, A kulci mani dǝmi gip ko unu pitǝn wi, ko na koshi naari ko na guzumi, ko gip zami bari ko gip holi bari. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Aa mani pi ko unu tǝp kar muntu kan ba bim ndǝrtǝn gwa.<verse eid="PHP 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Kup na untu ar mbuni in ra nan kǝ nem amra gip ghuntǝn gǝn gwa. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Kǝn mbarǝm kǝ filibbi kǝ mom ca'e, nan a nǝm mbap pi wazu kǝ zo shirǝm mǝn tǝmtǝni, nan a za atl kǝ Makidoniyawo mǝn kopi Yesu jen ra kan mo gam namǝn kǝba bii bar na nǝmi gwa da'a se kǝn katl. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Kup na kan a'i gip Makidoniya wo, kǝ karim bar na bar ju a ndu gwa ba'e bisi nǝm da'a. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Ba'e ami ni den ngeni bii bar ju da'a, ama amini den ngeni argon tu baa mbǝli ra in den zami gin gwa. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />A nǝm ɓatltǝn gǝn wi ar man kandatu a kur nǝm ma gwa, argon tu a ndu'o a zam wi, kǝkǝn kan a nǝm bar ju kǝ karim bar nari wi tǝp kar Abafǝroditus gwa. Bi bar mǝn tǝmi kasǝr/tǝmtǝn ni, hadaya ni kan ba ndu gwa, ar ba tǝmi Yam bi. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Yam gǝn baa bii in bar ju kǝ ndu gwa tǝp kǝba ɗǝɗatǝn gǝs mǝn nartǝn gip Almasihu Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Ɗǝɗatǝno kǝ Yam Baa gǝmi ni ar ri patǝn kǝ bari. Ar dǝm untu.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shirmitǝn kǝ pa'i bisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Shirmi ni mbarǝm kǝ Yam ka ra gip Almasihu Yesu. Ɓyar kan ra ɗe namǝn ba shirmi'in ka. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Mbarǝm kǝ Yam kup ba shirmi'in ka, tun ba munju kan mǝn bom kǝ Kaisar gwa da'a. <verse eid="PHP 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Dǝ zo bii bar kǝ Babom Yesu Almasihu kop na ruhu gini. Ar dǝm untu.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>